  "worked_solution": "To find the $x$-intercepts of the hyperbola, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{36}-{y}^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{36}-{0}^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{36} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =36 \\\\ x & =\\pm 6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $x$-intercepts are  $(\\pm 6,0).$",
